LuaIDE for BuzzOS

A simple desktop Lua development environment.

Features:
  - Syntax highlighting (keywords, strings, comments, numbers)
  - Keyword / library auto-complete (Tab, Up/Down, Enter)
  - New / Save buffer to a file under /fs
  - Run current buffer through the embedded Lua 5.4 engine
  - Interactive REPL line at the bottom

Toolbar:
  Open    browse with Files and open the chosen file (new window)
  New     create a file via Files (name dialog), then open it
  Save    write the current path
  Run     execute the whole editor buffer
  REPL    focus the bottom input line
  Clear   clear the output panel

Default document: /fs/luaide.lua
Double-click a .lua file in Files also opens LuaIDE.
Picker protocol for other apps: launch Files with argument
  openfor:/fs/apps/<app>   or   newfor:/fs/apps/<app>
